el Alive 瞬间：让人觉得活着真好的四种时刻", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "莱西和西恩的 Feel Alive 瞬间：让人觉得活着真好的四种时刻", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "overview_thesis"}}, {"id": "B_line_0007", "type": "line", "x": 80, "y": 222, "width": 1040, "height": 1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#346F64", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.8, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1.1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 7, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 138, "customData": {"stroke_role": "rule"}, "points": [[0, 0], [1040, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null}, {"id": "B_t_0008", "type": "text", "x": 80, "y": 238, "width": 1040, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#27534B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 8, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false, "updated": 1, "seed": 8, "text": "活人感不靠人生高光：被充电、没负担、被重新启动的小瞬间，散\n在城市与自然、具体的人、一个人的时刻和计划之外。", "fontSize": 32, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "活人感不靠人生高光：被充电、没负担、被重新启动的小瞬间，散\n在城市与自然、具体的人、一个人的时刻和计划之外。", "autoResize": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "customData": {"typography_role": "page_conclusion"}}, {"id": "B_t_0009", "type": "text", "x": 80.8, "y": 238, "width": 1040, "height": 80.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#27534B", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "roundness": null, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 8, "isDeleted": false, "boundElem